{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2aaade4b70a9f41fbb44f01daee216e924b8378008a6990daa0bac9ad9721236", "ja": "（桃子がローカル局の番組に出演する事になった。\nええと、控え室は……）", "zh": "（桃子要去地方电视台的节目出演了。嗯，休息室在……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1001_director", "source_sha256": "a1052aa49036a23339bdef12b7866c3a0c5cf3a67852a82198b50a1fb12f1c71", "ja": "あれっ？　……もしかしてキミ、周防桃子？", "zh": "哎？……难道你就是，周防桃子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "482b480f5f223043ffa2a6a723e97dc99f8c98d77f0df0b9c3c587e6ae4f7077", "ja": "え？　……あっ。", "zh": "诶？……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2ab75d999ba1c2948d5a61af198b4485eaf2b88f9a78a5da2e41f043a7b55b7a", "ja": "？　桃子、知り合いか？", "zh": "？桃子，你认识他吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "4f9088b260546b8c852f66f57dee8bde520578fd215a113a10de509d2908861a", "ja": "う、うん。昔、桃子がドラマに出た時に、\nお仕事したディレクターさん……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。是以前桃子拍电视剧的时候，\n合作过的一位导演……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1005_director", "source_sha256": "6542ec538463fdafb32d03cfdd966d12d8b0cb2dc915a2ae0a021e3edd83a81c", "ja": "やっぱり！\n芸能活動復帰したってウワサ、本当だったんだ。", "zh": "果然！\n关于复出演艺活动的传闻，是真的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4ef59dab003ee43d898ff343d07d0680510f7af56523f83d8123fc122ecf7e05", "ja": "すみません、うちの周防に何か？\nご用件があれば、私が伺いますが。", "zh": "不好意思，请问您找我们家周防有什么事吗？\n如果您有什么事，我来听您说就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1008_director", "source_sha256": "37ff954e365e60a52cf39d08d3660531eb67ae5008808442186d016e8793dd0d", "ja": "おたくは……へえ、プロデューサーさん？\n周防さんさぁ、ワガママで大変でしょ！", "zh": "您是……哦，制作人先生？\n周防小姐她啊，很任性，很难应付吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6682df8f7cd81a33dc1bfdb8c4c6989c69b634260abb6008a4f304df5d82909d", "ja": "いえ、そんな事はありませんよ。\n仕事熱心で、助かっています。", "zh": "没有的事。\n她对工作很投入，帮了我大忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1010_director", "source_sha256": "b8ae035dc9493a4460580ca02da85c34ad87566d2bbac065a3230cf74584371c", "ja": "またまた！\nあ、それともおたくも意識高い系ってやつ？", "zh": "又来了！\n啊，还是说你也是那种所谓的“觉悟很高”的类型？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1011_director", "source_sha256": "87fcd1be972cd13b4611ce36ee923327550287246c1994459de72359a62ccfd2", "ja": "ウチで仕事した時だって、「こんないい加減な台本じゃ\n演技できない」なんて、文句言って……。", "zh": "就连在我这儿工作的时候，也还抱怨说：“这种敷衍的剧本，根本没法演……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "902e94936c94a2873f8693f17109ab11f598448372b031fe0ed4bf9270b176f4", "ja": "……っ。", "zh": "……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7468401a8dd35e9bcb7c5b7b719319feec1c9298429b57bbf7184bdfe6da4946", "ja": "そういった事情も承知の上です。\nご忠告、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "我也明白其中的情况。\n谢谢您的提醒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c35da61db984fc344efad0a79156b43f34336ddbd629bfdb5d63a0220af82a89", "ja": "収録の時間ですので、失礼します。\n行こう、桃子。", "zh": "到录音的时间了，我先失陪。\n走吧，桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "cd6e106421cec1fb8f18e4393fd5f379904e3e06fee6448e3405ebf757cb6d57", "ja": "う、うん。\n……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "796458b4f7b935afa4414598c2399e8e265fda40a5178544bbadb1a9e41b9133", "ja": "あ、あの、お兄ちゃん。\nその……桃子の昔のこと、知ってたの……。", "zh": "啊、那个，哥哥。\n那个……你知道桃子以前的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1018_p", "source_sha256": "38f53ea48c4a00d60d044440ea00ac13b71561c08556dcd539ac496bc3e46db0", "ja": "ああ、後から聞いたよ。\nちょっとした、ウワサ話程度だけどね。", "zh": "啊，后来我听说了。\n不过只是听到了一点传闻而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "d2f7339807394dc677b4ed572965dc7059a1ad071145df59f5e06162af4269e0", "ja": "そう……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7c7da9e09a1c5a88a7ff00d76f8cca764757d3aaa5952908ac1212f77c83f405", "ja": "聞いたけど、俺は桃子から話を聞くまで、\n鵜呑みにするつもりはないよ。", "zh": "我是听说了，不过在听桃子亲口说之前，我不会全盘相信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "323ddf9ebc37ecd12960812070dcadd1a9ae2062a08ab87ccebe85d99a31162a", "ja": "ううん。……あの人の言うとおりだよ。\n桃子、すごくえらそうだったし。", "zh": "不。……那个人说得没错。桃子当时确实一副很了不起的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "2e765a03936d03a9516f641747d8fdd446dee3ea9675527d852724f7365f443d", "ja": "小さいころからお芝居してて、\nずっと、上手だってほめられてたから。", "zh": "桃子从小就开始演戏，\n而且一直都被夸演得好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "df8c6dcf7629d25308a9f362f1b69989285cdb2e4fe2dbd1f9715490443ad1e1", "ja": "他の子とお芝居すると、「みんな、どうして\nこんなこともできないの」って思ってた。", "zh": "和其他人一起演戏时，我总会想：“大家为什么连这么简单的事都做不到呢？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "18ccac7894280230308b26b462f3df47583968de5537b5e587f1cf8277ceb5b6", "ja": "だからみんなに嫌われてて。余計に\nうまくいかなくなって、文句ばっかり言って……。", "zh": "所以大家都讨厌我。结果事情变得越来越不顺利，我也只会一个劲儿地抱怨……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "5ca29c6d935bd2bb01225461a49c9102b140f5e164c4eb63e4cb2e541f766186", "ja": "そのあと、いろいろなことがあったけど……\n友達も、誰も……いないから……相談できなくて……。", "zh": "那之后发生了很多事，可是……\n连朋友也没有……谁都……不在……所以……没法商量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "c23f5a36437a09b8b9320736acac6a565ca4522d2b7bdbcdcf365adb8532087f", "ja": "桃子がワガママを言って、みんなを困らせたら……\n戻ってきてくれるんじゃないかって……。", "zh": "如果桃子任性一点，让大家为难的话……大家是不是就会回来呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "5fb8e982afb4cd60b2c88db214312b59b5f454a0d3cae7ef24657f17d8b1c122", "ja": "桃子は、どんどんワガママになっていって……\n大切なものをなくすまで、気がつかなかった……。", "zh": "桃子变得越来越任性……直到失去重要的东西，才终于察觉到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1029_p", "source_sha256": "e63635e53cb33c8892ae5760ca9ffae09d70f6d24b96810d64b2b8f8d8f6bae4", "ja": "大切なものって？", "zh": "重要的东西是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "3f8d63269d80b1e5790f0a4ec0b38cae1ee7d7c139ceee4ba89449398611ea3c", "ja": "……それは、……仕事とか。", "zh": "……那就是……工作之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1031_p", "source_sha256": "96cb64af5de49846bfa9b5bd1658770965632918d8031f0f67a0af9bee5a8bff", "ja": "そうか。……辛い事を話してくれてありがとうな。", "zh": "原来如此。……谢谢你愿意告诉我这些难过的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "c5dd7eb7af4f0363e0d46aba0962caef0f6dc06a4a6640d6220aad6efb17d474", "ja": "ううん……。", "zh": "不会……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1033_p", "source_sha256": "0cff2821456a4b54892e753139860479efdbf82f663656e461fe6f2615c948ee", "ja": "話したい事があれば、いつでも言ってくれ。\n桃子が話してもいいと思えるまで、待つからな。", "zh": "有什么想说的，随时都可以告诉我。等到桃子觉得可以开口为止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "61753f46bcdebe032e05c8742de4198197cbc6159c3cb4bd8ecd2f517cd4d056", "ja": "キャッ！？", "zh": "呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1051_049mom", "source_sha256": "d6a6c3e90d4692632ff4202a6c4b41b95b3873a3f5b8dc4b081e9a4ab1f6d03b", "ja": "も、もう。桃子は小さい子じゃないのに、\n頭を撫でるなんて……！", "zh": "真、真是的。桃子明明已经不是小孩子了，居然还摸我的头……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "6997d100f83d5a04626f51d59da54555f268d05705f95c904b4c5976d13cda66", "ja": "こ、子ども扱いしないで……。", "zh": "别、别把桃子当小孩子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1036_p", "source_sha256": "67791fcbaf8fa2df8bd43b2fd3ecace1f6b59f05232bbc4273843d3058e52346", "ja": "そうだな。桃子は立派に仕事をしてる。\nけど、立派に仕事をしていても、子どもでいいんだよ。", "zh": "是啊。桃子已经能出色地完成工作了。\n不过，就算工作完成得很出色，也可以还是个孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "f581cda3869dcb6637ecae2762cfee6d02a8c01ae650853da4a2a674ac243056", "ja": "お兄ちゃん……。", "zh": "大哥哥……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1038_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1039_staff", "source_sha256": "a26072c7070fcd62862f297b8750e92069d298ecf7a18de3c292e5c07016d36d", "ja": "失礼します！\n周防さん、スタンバイお願いしまーす！", "zh": "打扰了！\n周防小姐，请准备候场——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1040_049mom", "source_sha256": "7a78f3a8e610eb2ef4d84e130a0b468e86fdf3e5d8f447d8936df0007f572323", "ja": "あっ、はい！　……お兄ちゃん、桃子が\n泣いたってこと、みんなにはナイショだからね！", "zh": "啊，好的！……哥哥，桃子哭过这件事，可要对大家保密哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1041_p", "source_sha256": "7f40633040dd25b49cfd730bfde400de4b4198d5571f87e1f749e4970047f223", "ja": "もちろん、誰にも言わないよ。", "zh": "当然，谁都不会告诉的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1042_049mom", "source_sha256": "fd8b3dcc8f07f1ddfea5b2aa719877c10707a8a24569379abe5dfe0026ea19a4", "ja": "……あの、お兄ちゃん。お兄ちゃんは、\nどうして桃子のこと、信じてくれるの……。", "zh": "……那个，哥哥。哥哥你为什么愿意相信桃子呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1043_p", "source_sha256": "9d1eb763b58caef29de14cfe185eb071541c8175ddbf58aa07fb796a1b62319b", "ja": "もちろん、本当にダメだと思ったら、ちゃんと言うよ。\nでも桃子は、そんなことしないって信じてる。", "zh": "当然，要是我真的觉得不行，我会好好说出来的。不过，我相信桃子不会做那种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1044_p", "source_sha256": "a68d94cdea7e7738c35c0cd12afa95aa04daa3b6b783198e9525a35a6cd6665b", "ja": "失ったものの大きさや後悔を知っている桃子が、\n同じ過ちを繰り返すとは思わないからな。", "zh": "深知失去事物的沉重与后悔的桃子，\n是绝不会重蹈覆辙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1045_049mom", "source_sha256": "f581cda3869dcb6637ecae2762cfee6d02a8c01ae650853da4a2a674ac243056", "ja": "お兄ちゃん……。", "zh": "大哥哥……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1046_049mom", "source_sha256": "b804b299b076727d14d1f3fbd22b3c4bb768443effa42ca8b650675e86174f8b", "ja": "も、もう。お兄ちゃんのくせに生意気。\n……桃子、いってくる！", "zh": "真、真是的。明明是哥哥，却这么嚣张。\n……桃子出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1047_p", "source_sha256": "183e5db9c75cf756b91927ba89c47c746d8a635e758cb41f8221e6f1c0a2fb67", "ja": "（桃子はそう言い残すと、スタジオに向かった。\nそして今日の仕事を、しっかりとこなしてみせた……）", "zh": "（桃子留下这句话后，便前往了摄影棚。随后，她也确确实实地完成了今天的工作……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1048_kantoku", "source_sha256": "176988ce951566db48eed00d803f4720351d9c381aa2502d60628dca47eee9b9", "ja": "カット！　周防さん、OKです！\nお疲れさまでした！", "zh": "卡！周防，没问题了！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1049_049mom", "source_sha256": "f3c86d2a8a3fae99a301e80e93fd5906b8424a04cf9e99dfa63cc16dea28d497", "ja": "はい、お疲れさまでした！　……えへっ。", "zh": "好的，辛苦了！……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_005_1050_p", "source_sha256": "a5adab522c815da920ca47527b3d5a3a630691c63a6b9fc1b50bd4dadfc928eb", "ja": "（撮影が終わると、桃子は漸く笑顔をみせた。\nいつでも、こんな笑顔ができるようにしないとな……）", "zh": "（拍摄结束后，桃子终于露出了笑容。我也得让她随时都能露出这样的笑容才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
